an. He collaborated with Andy Warhol in the 1980s and his importance in the art world began to climb."}, {"time": "38000", "image": "engenn6le06ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "He received critical acclaim for his inspiring creativity. Soon, his paintings became the biggest draw cards at art exhibitions, many easily paying $50,000 for an original. At one point in his career, the 25-year-old exhibited nearly 60 paintings in Hanover, Germany - becoming the youngest artist to showcase his work there. Sadly, Basquiat died on August 12, 1988, in New York City."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le06ob04re5aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le06ob04re6aud09"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 3, "_data": []}]}]}